<!--
  sui-icon.before.sui — EXISTING look (repo). Normalizes a slotted <svg> to an
  em-relative box so it scales with surrounding text. Naive: no fixed sizing
  scale, baseline rides a touch low next to text. Compiled as <x-icon-before>.
  Props: (none here — sizes by font-size). Slot: an <svg>.
-->
<style>
  :host { display: inline-block; color: inherit; }
  ::slotted(svg) { width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; }
</style>
<slot></slot>
